you've lost forever.

378
00:14:59,295 --> 00:15:01,997
But if you really want us
to be your second family,

379
00:15:02,064 --> 00:15:04,733
then you've gotta start
treating us like one,

380
00:15:04,800 --> 00:15:07,402
even if that means supporting us

381
00:15:07,470 --> 00:15:09,838
