We're definitely going
to Applebee's, right?

389
00:15:37,712 --> 00:15:39,079
Yeah.

390
00:15:39,147 --> 00:15:40,814
I'm getting into a fight
no matter what today, dude.

391
00:15:40,882 --> 00:15:42,316
No matter what!

392
00:15:42,283 --> 00:15:44,385
Look who showed.

393
00:15:44,452 --> 00:15:48,288
Oh, check him out. Ahh...ahh!

394
00:15:48,356 --> 00:15:51,125
