their teeth knocked out, huh?

397
00:15:54,896 --> 00:15:56,430
Can I ask you a question?

398
00:15:56,498 --> 00:15:58,532
Are you perpetually
on your way to the gym?

399
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:00,200
