455
00:19:26,743 --> 00:19:28,477
You being our Spanish teacher...

456
00:19:28,544 --> 00:19:29,711
Eh.

457
00:19:29,779 --> 00:19:32,247
Whoa.

458
00:19:32,315 --> 00:19:34,116
Man, Mike got you good.

459
00:19:34,183 --> 00:19:36,184
Actually, uh,
that was my present to Jeff.

460
00:19:36,252 --> 00:19:39,788
