I got a Mountain to shred.

461
00:19:39,856 --> 00:19:43,392
Jeffrey, you're a man now.

462
00:19:43,459 --> 00:19:44,526
How's it feel?

463
00:19:44,594 --> 00:19:46,161
I got hit in the face, like, four times

464
00:19:46,229 --> 00:19:47,562
